{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00961","headline":"横吹曲辞 入塞 · 刘希夷","name":"横吹曲辞 入塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军陷虏围，边务息戎机。\n霜雪交河尽，旌旗入塞飞。\n晓光随马度，春色伴人归。\n课绩朝明主，临轩拜武威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00961.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00961","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}